	<section_number>15.2-2614</section_number>
	<catch_line>Bearer, registered or book entry form</catch_line>
	<text>
		The bonds may be issued in bearer, registered or book entry form, or any combination of such forms, as the governing body may determine.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 15-666.43; 1958, c. 640; 1962, c. 623, § 15.1-202; 1991, c. 668, § 15.1-227.16; 1997, c. 587.</history>
